      ],
      "walkthrough": [
        "One complete oscillation spans 5.8 cm on the trace.",
        "The period is T = 5.8 \u00d7 5.0 \u00d7 10\u207b\u2074 = 2.9 \u00d7 10\u207b\u00b3 s.",
        "Use \u03bb = vT = 330 \u00d7 2.9 \u00d7 10\u207b\u00b3.",
        "The wavelength of the sound is 0.96 m."
